# Cargo targets (`bin NAME` / `package NAME`) cited but not in either
# workspace, each with why. Checked by the second half of check_doc_paths.sh.
#
# A plan and its results quoting, verbatim, the plants the review asked for
# (M38): `--bin serde` was R17-F3's injection -- a dependency's name that
# the old check accepted as a binary. Rewording a historical plan is the
# worse choice.
bin serde
# The Step 1 firewall experiment's GENERATED workspace
# (experiments/firewall/generated, from scripts/gen_firewall.py): its
# packages exist only after the generator runs, in a workspace of its own.
package root
package compNNN
package monolith
